<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Before you order</span>
      <h2>Common questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="acc reveal">
      <div class="acc__item" data-open="false">
        <button class="acc__q" aria-expanded="false">
          How much does a custom sign cost?
          <svg class="acc__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="acc__a"><p>Signs start at <span data-ph>₹2,250</span> for a small design and rise with size and character count. The customizer shows your exact price as you type, so there are no surprises.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc__item" data-open="false">
        <button class="acc__q" aria-expanded="false">
          What size should I get?
          <svg class="acc__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="acc__a"><p>Small (40 × 20 cm) suits a desk or shelf. Medium (60 × 30 cm) is the most popular and sits well above a bed or sofa. Large (90 × 45 cm) is for feature walls, events and shopfronts. Send us your wall photo on WhatsApp and we'll mark up the scale for you.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc__item" data-open="false">
        <button class="acc__q" aria-expanded="false">
          Is it real neon gas?
          <svg class="acc__ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="acc__a"><p>No — these are LED neon flex, and that's a good thing. They use roughly a tenth of the power of glass neon, don't get hot, won't shatter, and are safe around children. The look is the same.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a class="head__link" href="/pages/faq">All questions →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Custom FAQ Teaser",
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Custom FAQ Teaser"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
